#[doc = "# Hosted plans, paid app and recipe marketplace\n\nStatus: Draft\nPriority: Could\nOrigin: Customer\nMilestone: M4\n\n## User value\nSustain the project with hosted tiers, paid app distribution and paid content.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n1. Given hosted registration, free and paid tiers describe their entitlements; prices/limits remain explicit product decisions rather than invented defaults.\n2. Given the official hosted service, paid signed distribution is intended as an admission condition with server-side entitlement checks; an embedded app secret alone is insufficient.\n3. Given a self-compiled client and an own server, AGPL rights and access to self-hosted features remain intact.\n4. Given a paid recipe or collection, purchase, author entitlement, licence, delivery, refunds and imported-content exclusion are validated before charging anyone.\n5. Given source distribution, complete corresponding source and applicable AGPL notices remain available independently of app purchase.\n\n## Out of scope\nPayments or production app attestation in this bootstrap.\n\n## UX notes\nUI flows, accessibility, empty/error states and user review points must be specified before Ready.\n\n## Links\nRequirement: [F19](../page_docs_requirements_md/index.html). Delivery tasks: [plan.md](../page_specs_0019_commercial_service_plan_md/index.html). Decisions: [adrs.md](../page_specs_0019_commercial_service_adrs_md/index.html).\n"]
